(Elaboration connects new information to what the learner already knows.) Tj T*
(Self-explanation describes why a solution step makes sense.) Tj T*
(Silencing optional notifications reduces interruptions during focus time.) Tj T*
(A planned break separates focus blocks and allows a pause before returning.) Tj T*
